Models
- Kokoro-82M v1.0 text-to-speech model and voicepacks by hexgrad: Apache-2.0
  (https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M). The default voice is bm_george; the
  operator accepted its Apache-2.0 licence and training-data provenance per upstream
  statement: "Kokoro was trained exclusively on permissive/non-copyrighted audio data
  and IPA phoneme labels". Bot-Office has not independently audited the training data. ONNX export from the kokoro-onnx project (MIT), release model-files-v1.1.
- Whisper English models by OpenAI: MIT. CTranslate2 conversions by SYSTRAN
  (Systran/faster-whisper-tiny.en, -base.en, -small.en): MIT.

Engine packages (exact versions and hashes in deploy/voice-requirements.txt)
- faster-whisper, CTranslate2, onnxruntime, kokoro-onnx, espeakng-loader, PyYAML, anyio,
  attrs, filelock, h11, dlinfo, truststore: MIT
- numpy: BSD-3-Clause AND 0BSD AND MIT AND Zlib AND CC0-1.0
- PyAV (av): BSD-3-Clause; its wheels include FFmpeg libraries under the LGPL
- tokenizers, huggingface_hub, hf-xet, flatbuffers: Apache-2.0
- click, httpx2, httpcore2, idna, fsspec, joblib, cloudpickle, protobuf: BSD-3-Clause
- packaging: Apache-2.0 OR BSD-2-Clause; tqdm: MPL-2.0 AND MIT; typing_extensions: PSF-2.0
- phonemizer: GPL-3.0-or-later, and espeak-ng (shipped inside espeakng-loader): GPL-3.0.
